Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 11:47:58 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 09/54] Trace the -wex-adlp-edp display bring-up in order

Hook AppleIntelFramebuffer::connectionChanged and getOnlineInfo and record
them, connection attributes, port probes, EDID reads, port enable/disable,
training patterns, Combo clock changes, boot adoption and AUX failures in
one time-ordered ring with framebuffer online state and link state.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
